WEBVTT

00:02:56.436 --> 00:03:01.716
communities of color and poor people
were disproportionately victimized.

00:03:02.036 --> 00:03:04.916
This storm continued on
north and northeast

00:03:04.956 --> 00:03:07.516
across North America to New York,

00:03:07.556 --> 00:03:09.796
New Jersey and Pennsylvania,

00:03:09.836 --> 00:03:13.276
killed a lot of people
and dropped rain bombs.

00:03:13.316 --> 00:03:15.356
And in New York City

00:03:15.396 --> 00:03:18.396
some basement apartments were flooded.

00:03:18.436 --> 00:03:24.036
And I appreciate this family giving me
the right to show this video.

00:03:26.436 --> 00:03:28.116
(Screams)

00:03:29.316 --> 00:03:31.876
He’s safe, the guy is screaming
for his mother.